    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VR and Non-VR Cross-Play</h2>Built from the ground up for both VR and Non-VR.  We don\u2019t discriminate.  Controller support too!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invite your Friends or Fly Solo</h2>Have up to 6 players in a party.  Play against bots, party members, or other players online.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons</h2>Collect a range of both useful and ridiculous weapons including a box of bees and bird blades.  Enjoy an unlimited amount of trusty spike balls!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities</h2>Character abilities will help you take down enemies.  Dash across the map, fire a homing missile, or freeze players in place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Danger!</h2>Flash storms? Burning sun rays? Falling lava rocks?  No problem.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo Challenges</h2>Test yourself with challenges to improve those shooting and driving skills!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">VR and Non-VR Cross-Play</h2>Built from the ground up for both VR and Non-VR.  We don\u2019t discriminate.  Controller support too!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invite your Friends or Fly Solo</h2>Have up to 6 players in a party.  Play against bots, party members, or other players online.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons</h2>Collect a range of both useful and ridiculous weapons including a box of bees and bird blades.  Enjoy an unlimited amount of trusty spike balls!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Abilities</h2>Character abilities will help you take down enemies.  Dash across the map, fire a homing missile, or freeze players in place.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Danger!</h2>Flash storms? Burning sun rays? Falling lava rocks?  No problem.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solo Challenges</h2>Test yourself with challenges to improve those shooting and driving skills!",
    "short_description": "Pilot a weaponized basket while dodging enemy fire and collecting weapons and traps to take down your opponents. Invite your friends, shoot them down, avoid getting shot down.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
